		{
			"id": "legend",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**One tile = one folder.** Each tile opens the step's documentation. Next to it in the same folder sit `NN TODO.md` — the checklist — and every note that step produces.\n\nThis is the only canvas. Steps do not get their own.",
			"x": -40,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 1000,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "gate",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Gate — nothing moves right without this**\n\n1 → 2  a named competitor gap, not a hunch\n2 → 3  a hook written down before any video exists\n3 → 4  a brief per campaign · 5 campaigns, 1 variable each\n4 → 5  QA passed · men only · AI disclosed · no unsourced stat\n5 → 5  hypothesis written **before** launch, then left alone through the learning phase",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 480,
			"width": 1000,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "t041",
